<a id="build"></a>
<h2>5. Build and verification</h2>
<p>Use Flutter 3.47.9, JDK 17 and the SDK level selected by the Flutter Gradle extension. From code/ run flutter pub get, flutter analyze, flutter test, then flutter build apk --debug. On a device install the APK with adb install -r. A matching signing certificate and application ID allow Android to retain private storage. For hardware acceptance, download the model, enter airplane mode, dictate a note, wait for silence and verify the final phrase and the microphone indicator. Repeat with a recorded edit, Cancel, Retry and the settings meter.</p>
@
